TI  - A Preliminary Cultural-Ecological Framework for Sustainable Material Selection in Balinese Architecture
AU  - Ni Wayan Ardiarani Utami
AU  - ST Dr. Ir. Ngakan Ketut Acwin Dwijendra
AU  - I Made Adhika
AU  - I Dewa Gede Agung Diasana Putra
