AB  - Purpose. The purpose of the study is to identify and comprehensively analyze trends in the development of the decorative stone extraction industry in Ukraine through an assessment of production dynamics, capital investment, and entrepreneurial activity, as well as to determine the key factors shaping the functioning, adaptation, and recovery of the industry under conditions of macroeconomic instability, regional concentration of production, and wartime challenges. Methodology. The study employs statistical-economic, comparative, structural, and regional analysis. This methodological approach made it possible to trace changes in the number of business entities, the volume of produced and sold output, capital investment, and to identify the territorial concentration of enterprises in the industry. Results. It has been established that in 2014–2023 the decorative stone extraction industry in Ukraine developed unevenly under the influence of crisis-related macroeconomic and wartime factors; however, it retained the capacity for adaptation and recovery. A reduction in the number of active business entities was identified, alongside a partial revival of entrepreneurial activity in 2023. The study demonstrates growth in production volumes over the long term, the cyclical nature of investment activity, and the dominance of investment in machinery and equipment. It was determined that Zhytomyr region is the main territorial center of the industry, while external demand for natural stone products supports its development prospects. Scientific novelty consists in the comprehensive integration of the analysis of production dynamics, capital investment, and entrepreneurial activity in the decorative stone extraction industry at both the national and regional levels, which made it possible to identify patterns in its functioning and recovery under conditions of wartime risks and economic instability. Practical significance of the obtained results lies in the possibility of using the formulated conclusions to substantiate directions for production modernization, improvement of sectoral policy, expansion of access to investment resources, development of export orientation, and enhancement of the competitiveness of enterprises in Ukraine’s stone extraction industry Key words: decorative stone, stone extraction, capital investment, entrepreneurial activity.
