TI  - INVESTIGATION OF THE POSSIBILITY OF USING GRANITE RAW MATERIAL FROM THE BİLECİK-BOZUYUK REGION IN TWO- COMPONENT SYSTEMS AT 1050°C, 1100°C AND 1200°C TEMPERATURES IN GLAZING RECIPES
AU  - Beyza Nur KUM
