TI  - Serpentinite as a strategic Earth material: geological controls, mineral reactivity, carbon mineralization, geologic hydrogen, and sustainable resource pathways
AU  - Mostafa R. Abukhadra
AU  - Seham M. Hamed
AU  - Ahmed A. Allam
AU  - Mohammad Ahmad Hamdan
AU  - Mahmoud M. Abu Saima
PY  - 2026
JO  - Environmental Earth Sciences
