TI  - Synergistic stabilization of frost-susceptible clay using waste marble powder, nanozeolite, and polyvinyl alcohol fibers for enhanced freeze-thaw durability
AU  - Aghileh Khajeh
AU  - Mahdi Salimi
AU  - Abolfazl Baghbani
AU  - Firas Daghistani
AU  - Mohammad Mahdi Shalchian
