TI  - 8279516 Autoimmune disease and prevalence of autoantibodies amongst workers exposed to high-dose respirable crystalline silica
AU  - Karen E Walker-Bone
AU  - Ryan Francis Hoy
AU  - Dunya Tomic
AU  - Deborah Catherine Glass
AU  - Stella May Gwini
AU  - Hayley Barnes
AU  - M. Nikpour
