TI  - Analysis of the influence of coupling agents on the composition of artificial rocks with polymer matrix
AU  - Marcelo Barcellos Reis
AU  - Elaine Aparecida Santos Carvalho
AU  - Geovana Carla Girondi Delaqua
AU  - Afonso Rangel Garcez de Azevedo
AU  - Sérgio Neves Monteiro
AU  - Carlos Maurício Fontes Vieira
