TI  - Automated engineered-stone silicosis screening and staging using Deep Learning with X-rays
AU  - Blanca Priego
AU  - Daniel Morillo
AU  - Ebrahim Khalili
AU  - Miguel Ángel Conde-Sánchez
AU  - Andrés García-Gámez
AU  - Antonio León‐Jiménez
