TI  - Recycling of abrasive sludge and lithium-ion batteries for the synthesis of mixed oxides applied in photocatalysis and energy storage
AU  - Mayra Nicoli Moura
PY  - 2025
JO  - riUfes (Universidade Federal do Espírito Santo)
