TI  - Investigation of strength, durability, and microstructure properties of concrete with waste marble powder as a partial replacement of cement
AU  - Sandeep Sathe
AU  - Sudhir Patil
AU  - Yash Nagesh Bhosale
PY  - 2024
JO  - World Journal of Engineering
DO  - 10.1108/wje-06-2024-0372
