AU  - A.M. Ali
AU  - Muhammad Majid Naeem
AU  - Fawad Ahmad
AU  - Fazle Subhan
PY  - 2024
JO  - Natural and Applied Sciences International Journal (NASIJ)
DO  - 10.47264/idea.nasij/5.1.4
