AB  - The scope of water jet technologies is multifaceted. These are abrasive water jet cutting technologies; cleaning the surface of metals and non-metals from any contamination; the ability to remove coatings layer by layer, including imparting new adhesive properties to the surface; decorative finishing of a surface of products; technology of complex shaped cutting of metals, plastics, glass and natural stone slabs; water-jet grouting of the base of the roadway. The use of water jet technologies sooner or later leads to the issue of the wear rate of the nozzles of a water jet tool. The task of determining the dependence of the intensity of wear of jet-forming devices required conducting comprehensive studies covering the formation of thin water jets of high pressure, their dynamics, the study of the process of jet destruction of a massif with different structure and strength, and the study of jet-forming elements. As a result of research and improvement of water jet technologies, in particular the influence of the wear factor of the flow path of a water jet tool, the efficiency will increase, and hence the range of equipment application in various industries.
