TI  - Weathering phenomena, rock physical properties and long-term restoration intervention: a case study from the St. Johannis Chapel of Lütgenrode (Lower Saxony, Germany)
AU  - Siegfried Siegesmund
AU  - Frank Wiese
AU  - Calvin Klein
AU  - Ulrich Huster
AU  - Christopher Pötzl
