TI  - Aspects regarding 3d modelling and finite element analysis of a crusher bucket
AU  - Gigel Florin Capatana
AU  - Maria Aurora Potîrniche
PY  - 2021
JO  - IOP Conference Series Materials Science and Engineering
DO  - 10.1088/1757-899x/1182/1/012012
