TI  - Evaluation of Concrete with Partial Replacement of Cement by Waste Marble Powder
AU  - Mushraf Majeed
AU  - Anwar Khitab
AU  - Waqas Anwar
AU  - Raja Bilal Nasar Khan
AU  - Affan Jalil
AU  - Zeesshan Tariq
PY  - 2021
JO  - Civil Engineering Journal
