 equipments , natural gas sensors etc in the underground of the Italy through the Geoscope. Setting up the Italy National Geoscope Project and maintain will also be useful in emerging industries such as geothermal and geo-sequestration etc.By establishing the Italy Monsoon Time Scale and maintain , the country can be estimated the impending weather conditions and natural calamities like rains, floods, landslides, avalanches, blizzard, droughts, extreme winter conditions, heavy rainfall, mudflows, extreme weather, cyclones, cloud bursts, sand storms, hails, and winds etc in advance. Surface water resources in advance.
