TI  - THE EFFECT OF GEOLOGICAL PROPERTIES OF DIMENSION STONES ON THE PREDICTION OF SPECIFIC ENERGY (SE) DURING DIAMOND WIRE CUTTING OPERATIONS
AU  - Mehrbod Khoshouei
AU  - Mohammad Hossein Jalalian
AU  - Raheb Bagherpour
