AU  - Domenico Calcaterra
AU  - Maurizio de’Gennaro
AU  - Massimo Ramondini
PY  - 2018
JO  - Quarterly Journal of Engineering Geology and Hydrogeology
DO  - 10.1144/qjegh2017-054
