TI  - Potential Use of Waste Marble Powder as an Adhesive Filler in the Manufacture of Laminated Veneer Lumber
AU  - Kadir Özkaya
AU  - Nadir Ayrılmış
AU  - Serkan Özdemir
PY  - 2015
JO  - BioResources
DO  - 10.15376/biores.10.1.1686-1695
