TI  - AN EXPERIMENTAL STUDY ON THE AVAILABILITY OF SOLID WASTE OF MINES AND QUARRIES AS COARSE AGGREGATE IN CONCRETE MIXES
AU  - Ahmed Abdul Mageed Ahmed
AU  - Khairy Hassan Abdel Kareem
AU  - Ahmed Mohamed Altohamy
AU  - Sherein Ahmed Mohamed Rizk
