TI  - Characterization of a Quartzite Residue and its Application in Red Clay Ceramics
AU  - Michelle Pereira Babisk
AU  - Wagner Souza Ribeiro
AU  - Mariane Costalonga de Aguiar
AU  - Sérgio Neves Monteiro
AU  - Carlos Maurício Fontes Vieira
