TI  - Hygrothermal Features of Laterite Dimension Stones for Sub-Saharan Residential Building Construction
AU  - Abdou Lawane
AU  - Raffaele Vinai
AU  - Anne Pantet
AU  - Jean‐Hugues Thomassin
AU  - Adamah Messan
