TI  - Finite Element Model Development Applied to Portuguese Granites for Contact Analysis of Two Dowel Fixing Conditions Used in Cladding
AU  - Vera Pires
AU  - André Pacheco
AU  - V. Infante
AU  - Pedro Miguel Amaral
AU  - Luı́s Guerra Rosa
