TI  - History of research in mineral resources : [35th Conference of the International Commission on the History of Geological Sciences, Madrid y Almadén(España), 1-14 julio 2010]
AU  - Jose Eugenio Ortíz Menéndez
AU  - Octavio Puche Riart
AU  - Isabel Rábano
AU  - Luis Felipe Mazadiego Martínez
PY  - 2010
