TI  - Copper-zinc hydroxychlorides: origin and occurrence as paint pigments in Arcos de la Frontera's Chapel of Mercy (Spain)
AU  - Francisco Javier Alejandre Sánchez
AU  - G. Márquez
PY  - 2006
JO  - European Journal of Mineralogy
DO  - 10.1127/0935-1221/2006/0018-0403
