AB  - yenites are traditional rock material used as a building stone
and ornamental rock especially in southwestern Moravia where
they are quarried in Třebic massif. Quarrying and processing of
these rocks were always in relation to construction practice
requests in wider area of source localities. The paper deals
with qualitative assessment of rock material from the point of
view of its primary properties. It also evaluates history and
present times of quarrying and processing and on selected
examples (from the past and present) documents application of
syenites as building stones including assessment of their
durability against to action of aggressive outer environment.
