TI  - Characterization of Granite Waste for Incorporation in Red Ceramic
AU  - Carlos Maurício Fontes Vieira
AU  - Sérgio Neves Monteiro
PY  - 2005
JO  - Materials science forum
DO  - 10.4028/www.scientific.net/msf.498-499.728
