AB  - The key goal of this paper is to determine new possibilities for the utilization of the limestone and dolomite extracted from the deposit Tanasijevic brdo in Cibutkovica in line with their characteristics. So far the limestone and dolomite extracted from this significant deposit had a rather limited use mainly in building industry [1 ]. The investigation results, which are presented in this paper, have shown that certain dolomitelimestone sediments found in the deposit Tanasijevic brdo in Cibutkovica may be used also as ornamental stone due to its attractive appearance (breccia-appearance). Some sediments of the limestone and dolomite rock mass are highly limonitic and they can be definitely denoted as ferruginuos dolomites and ferruginuos limestone. The occurrence of limonite in the form of pigments indicate a significant presence of iron, which practically restricts their use as a filler in rubber or paper industries considering that the raw materials used should be free from impurities and with the lowest possible content of harmful components. Bearing in mind the quality of this raw material it may be successfully used in ferrous metallurgy in extraction processes during iron and steel production.
