TI  - Automated visual inspection for polished stone manufacture
AU  - Melvyn Lionel Smith
AU  - Lyndon Neal Smith
PY  - 2003
JO  - Proceedings of SPIE, the International Society for Optical Engineering/Proceedings of SPIE
DO  - 10.1117/12.477511
