UR  - http://en.cnki.com.cn/Article_en/CJFDTOTAL-KYYK200106006.htm
AB  - A fractal simulation is made of the fault distribution during the evolving process of micro fissuring of dimension stone. The feasibility is discussed of using sub dimension number m of the fault distribution to describe the strength of dimension stone. A critical fragmentation coefficient C 0 is proposed as an evaluation for fragmentation and fissuring and the corresponding formula is given.
