AB  - The strongly zero-dimensional frames, that is, the completely regular frames with zero-dimensional Stone-Cech dompactificatin, are characterized internally by the transitivity of their fine, or equivalently, their Stone-Cech uniformity. Further, this result is extended to a large class of other functoria uniformities, and several appoications are derived.
